# Acceptance Criteria — Platform & Compliance

<!--
  Output: Planning Agent (Fase 02). Kontrak uji untuk Implementation & Reviewer.
  VERIFIABLE. Implementer menulis kode agar lolos ini; Reviewer mengecek. Jangan ubah kriteria agar lulus.
